        "rating": 2,
        "relative_time_description": "10 months ago",
        "text": "It's very inviting since it's a helathy biscoti, But here are the two things that I found against its healthy ingredients.\n1,The amount of Sugar in it is extremly tooo much,that as a sweet tooth i couldn't handle.\n2,I found some type of sand kind of thing,I thought it was just too dry but it was sand.\nPlease be adviced!!\nHow can it be healthy?",
        "time": 1742856868,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Antonia Benton",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113790570855011194625/reviews",
        "language": "en",
