        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIrdOIXu2JSCSQkUC93HvY8qNkx-Ql9dRhkF71Hep5kBTK5zg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a month ago",
        "text": "Amazon true biscotti. Perfect for dipping in coffee!",
        "time": 1766934073,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Adamo Bernola",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/112905075795865839362/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJmRWqD6rBa60XAYI1rocGrqKLImlcO6mgJPX0sE12Bgv5rGw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 years ago",
        "text": "I've been told that the #1 key to any successful business is customer service. And I've never experienced it first hand like I have with Michael. Very genuine and kind. Tutti Gourmet's snacks are amazing as well! Especially their orange biscotti. Proud customer!",
        "time": 1528854212,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Holly Byers",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/109773080359667485118/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVFfwmOq_GjqW_X4bjtvtrhQYbQYAI0mLe4IWvAQ7IMvZ4ikdUp=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "10 years ago",
        "text": "Feb. 18th, 2015\nHI Folks!\n\nI was eating your GLUTEN-FREE ORANGE & CHOCOLATE BISCOTTI -as I watched you on Dragon's DenDRAGON'S DEN (CBC at 20H this evening) , and CONGRATULATE YOU on your success in being chosen and supported by Arlene!!! BRAVO to ALL!!!!!\n\nAfter meeting you at the CFHA - MONTREAL Feb 6 & 7th, (2015), and tasting your line of products, I am completely convinced that you are going to SAIL (SALE) through the upcoming years!\n\nYour Gluten Free Biscottis - were / are outstanding, as are your GLUTEN-FREE  Fruit Crackers-BANA KRISPS: Pistachio & Anise, Cafe, and Fruits. All ARE decisious, and I salute your pastry-chef- husband in creating (FINALLY) some form of cracker in the gluten-free market, that DOES INDEED DELIVER AMAZING FLAVOUR, and that DOES have consistancy !!!\n\nI am also equally impressed by you Cara and Jack with your simple, frank and passionate demo'ing of your product at CHFA. You DESERVE EVERY SUCCESS !!!\n\nIt would be my abosulte pleasure to demo your product at ANY time! Sincerely.\nI'll follow your progress with enthusiasm.\n\nCheers\n~HOlly Byers",
        "time": 1426697584,
        "translated": false
      },
